{\b\fs28 HK-47 from The Old Republic}\par
for Star Wars: Knights of the Old Republic\par
\par
{\b What this does}\par
Replaces HK-47's model with The Old Republic's HK-47, on a skeleton fitted to the new geometry so every part hinges where it should. His vanilla animations are kept.\par
\par
Also replaces his party portraits: the icon, its silhouette, and the full-body party selection image, all rendered from the new model.\par
\par
{\b Files installed to Override}\par
p_hk47.mdl, p_hk47.mdx - the model\par
tor_hk47.tga, tor_hk47.txi - the texture, with a faint metallic reflection\par
po_phk47.tga, po_phk472.tga, po_phk473.tga - the portraits\par
\par
{\b Compatibility}\par
Conflicts with any other mod that replaces p_hk47 or HK-47's portraits. Install this last if you want these to win. No 2DA, dialogue or script files are changed.\par
\par
{\b Known limits}\par
The Old Republic models HK-47's hands open, so his fingers do not close around a weapon. His fingers and toes do not articulate. One-handed pistols sit slightly forward in his hand.\par
\par
{\b Uninstall}\par
The installer backs up any file it replaces. Restore those backups, or delete the seven files above from Override to return to vanilla.\par
